{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011Cg6TGbp4ozLMqxp4Sk3xM", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "```\nTable 3 reports the estimates, and they show that who writes a review matters, not just what it says. In column 2, the coefficient on the identity-disclosed indicator is 0.18 (SE = 0.04). It remains 0.15 (SE = 0.05) in column 3 after adding product fixed effects, so the identity effect is not an artifact of unobserved product differences. Reviewer tenure strengthens it: the interaction in column 4 is 0.09 (SE = 0.03). Star rating, by comparison, carries a coefficient of 0.42 (SE = 0.02) across all specifications. R-squared rises from 0.31 to 0.47 across the columns. All coefficients are significant at the 1% level except the interaction, which is significant at the 5% level.\n```"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1878, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1496, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1878}, "output_tokens": 2, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "19b6103d-cbfc-505f-8dc1-c40cc8379cf6", "uuid": "cf611222-4df7-4b14-9cc9-8f4685c3b2c8", "timestamp": "2026-10-16T19:17:22.774Z", "request_id": "req_011Cg6TGbYCU7jWYxeFGtYy5"}
